# Enterprise Code

This directory is part of the Kodus Enterprise Edition.

It is licensed under the Kodus Enterprise License (see `/license_ee.md` at the
repository root), **not** the AGPL-3.0 that covers the rest of the monorepo.

Files under `libs/ee/heavy-mode/` implement heavy mode for code review: the
specialist lenses, how they run, and the plan that allows them. Production use
requires a valid Teams or Enterprise commercial agreement with Kodus.
